# SauceDemo Manual Testing Project

## Overview

This repository contains a complete Manual Testing project for the SauceDemo web application.

## Application Under Test

Website: https://www.saucedemo.com/

## Project Scope

- Login Module
- Products Module
- Shopping Cart
- Checkout Process
- Logout

## Testing Types

- Functional Testing
- Smoke Testing
- Regression Testing
- Positive Testing
- Negative Testing

## Test Artifacts

- Test Plan
- Login Test Cases
- Products Test Cases
- Cart Test Cases
- Checkout Test Cases
- Bug Report
- Test Summary Report

## Tools Used

- Microsoft Excel
- Microsoft Word
- GitHub
- Google Chrome

